{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Bnk74tKJNf1793177594.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美聯物業東涌區域營業董事范偉康表示，該行最新促成東環二手成交，位於5B座低層8室，實用面積約378平方呎，屬1房間隔，單位以485萬元成交，折合實用呎價約12,830元。</p><p></p><p>資料顯示，原業主於2015年1月以約411.6萬元購入上述物業，持貨約11年，帳面獲利約73.4萬元，升值約17.8%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:48.084674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:10.101535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:10.101535+00:00","content_hash":"6d0edc74864fc095c992363130d9512c9b9f7b5b0076140c4259026e30210c6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}